    {
      "title": "インターネット出口は経路・SNAT・許可で考える",
      "notes": "0.0.0.0/0のUDRは、より具体的な宛先経路がない通信をFirewall/NVAへ誘導します。外部通信には出口のSNATや許可規則が必要です。検査が不要で送信元IP固定などが目的ならNAT Gatewayも選択肢ですが、NAT GatewayはFirewallのような通信検査を行いません。2026年3月31日以降にリリースされたAPIでは新規VNetのサブネットが既定でプライベートとなるため、暗黙の送信アクセスに依存しない設計が必要です。",
      "sources": [
        {"label":"Microsoft Learn: 既定の送信アクセス","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/ip-services/default-outbound-access"}
      ],
      "elements": [
        {"kind":"text","x":65,"y":135,"w":230,"h":35,"text":"1  経路","size":21,"color":"#000FB3","bold":true,"align":"center"},
        {"kind":"text","x":65,"y":190,"w":230,"h":68,"text":"0.0.0.0/0\\n→ FirewallのIP","size":18,"color":"#202020","align":"center"},
        {"kind":"arrow","x1":305,"y1":215,"x2":365,"y2":215,"color":"#0078D4","width":2},
        {"kind":"text","x":375,"y":135,"w":230,"h":35,"text":"2  出口","size":21,"color":"#000FB3","bold":true,"align":"center"},
        {"kind":"text","x":375,"y":190,"w":230,"h":68,"text":"FirewallのSNAT\\nまたはNAT Gateway","size":18,"color":"#202020","align":"center"},
        {"kind":"arrow","x1":615,"y1":215,"x2":675,"y2":215,"color":"#0078D4","width":2},
        {"kind":"text","x":685,"y":135,"w":220,"h":35,"text":"3  許可","size":21,"color":"#000FB3","bold":true,"align":"center"},
        {"kind":"text","x":685,"y":190,"w":220,"h":68,"text":"Firewall規則\\nNSG / OS / アプリ","size":18,"color":"#202020","align":"center"},
        {"kind":"rect","x":100,"y":320,"w":760,"h":74,"fill":"#FFF4CE","line":"#F7630C"},
        {"kind":"text","x":120,"y":334,"w":720,"h":48,"text":"Internetへのルートがあるだけでは、外部接続は保証されない","size":20,"color":"#202020","bold":true,"align":"center"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ゲートウェイ共有・Virtual WAN・Route Server",
      "notes": "VNetピアリングでHubのゲートウェイをSpokeに共有する場合、Hub側のAllow gateway transitとSpoke側のUse remote gatewaysを対応させます。これはFirewall検査や一般的な推移転送を有効にする設定ではありません。Virtual WANは接続をマネージドハブで集約するサービス、Azure Route ServerはAzureとNVAの間でBGP経路交換を行うサービスで、Route Server自体はデータパケットを中継・検査しません。",
      "sources": [
        {"label":"Microsoft Learn: VPN Gateway Transit","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/vpn-gateway/vpn-gateway-peering-gateway-transit"},
        {"label":"Microsoft Learn: Azure Route Server","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/route-server/overview"}
      ],
      "elements": [
